een anti-lgbt  ltgb  q or are they you know suddenly  discovering that the talking point again  was we are doing this because we want to  protect the children  oh how could you dare protect the  children  because democrats don't see the freight  train coming down the track with  hard-working god-fearing hispanic voters  riding in it  if they don't see that then they're  going to get wiped out by the group that  they  wanted to simply throw together with  other minority voters take them for  granted  by this bright lights pelosi and schumer  should have paid attention to what  happened in virginia last november  in jason miaris they elected the state's  first hispanic attorney general  but while the swamp remained tone deaf  and stuck in their old paradigms miara's  focused on common sense and crime  but instead of giving latinos pragmatic  solutions to the problems plaguing their  communities democrats gave them a new  nickname  latinx students are more likely to  borrow money to go to college it's awful  hard as well  to get  latinx vaccinated as well i've had the  chance to meet with latinx leaders and  no matter where i connect with latinx  communities one thing is certain latinx  families are feeling squeezed to the  breaking point  it turns out that actual latino voters  hate the term according to a new survey  by echelon insights  how embarrassing  the republicans message to latino voters  here should be pretty straightforward  and clear  if you want a better life for your  children a chance for a thriving  business safer streets  real respect for your faith and values  and schools that teach without  propaganda then say goodbye to the  democrat party  if you want a future though for your  kids that leaves them with no real  options other than maybe pot porn and  government checks then stay with biden's  crew absolutely  the truth is the liberals don't really  like you  they just use you and they talk down to  you every single campaign season  they think you'r